{"description":"When a file under assets/art/ is edited, ask the agent to check whether the README gallery index and the SEED_ART metadata in app.js still match the art on disk (piece count, titles, artist handles, years), and update them if a piece was added, removed, or renamed.","enabled":true,"name":"README Gallery Sync","then":{"prompt":"A file under assets/art/ was just edited. Compare the .txt files in assets/art/ against (1) the Gallery Index table in README.md and (2) the SEED_ART entries in app.js. If a piece was added, removed, or renamed, or if a title/artist/year disagrees, update README.md and the SEED_ART metadata so all three match. Do not change the artwork content itself, and do not touch any other files.","type":"askAgent"},"version":"1","when":{"patterns":["assets/art/**"],"type":"fileEdited"}}